This package is a DeepSeek Harness (DSH) client plugin. It is distributed
together with the Planner skill family, whose review-surface contract it
consumes:

- review-surface contract: planners-review-core (02-skills-library/00-system)
- first consumer: planners-ppt-hell

Attribution may appear in repository documents, plugin UI, process HTML
pages, review pages, validation pages and developer workflow surfaces.
The plugin should not add project branding to final client deliverables.
